{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04780","headline":"对酒行巴陵作 · 张说","name":"对酒行巴陵作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"留侯封万户，园令寿千金。\n本爲成王业，初由赋上林。\n繁荣安足恃，霜露递相寻。\n鸟哭楚山外，猿啼湘水阴。\n梦中城阙近，天畔海云深。\n空对忘忧酌，离忧不去心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}